[l_english.EQUIPMENT_TANK_TITAN_TIREK_INVINCIBLE]
Tirek (Titan)

[l_english.EQUIPMENT_TANK_TITAN_TIREK_INVINCIBLE_desc]
When you have the magic of half the world, when you have the strength to dominate everything, when you have achieved the conquest you have always dreamed of, what else do you desire?
§g“Hey! Burn the forests down!”§!

